      "responsibilities": "<ul><li>Design and develop new features for web and mobile applications.</li><li>Maintain and update application source code to ensure stability and performance.</li><li>Create responsive and visually appealing user interfaces using Tailwind, JavaScript and/or Typescript.</li><li>Develop back-end services using programming languages NestJS.</li><li>Manage and optimize application databases to ensure efficiency and reliability.</li><li>Collaborate with product and design teams to understand user needs and design effective solutions.</li></ul><p><br></p>",
      "requirements": "<ul><li>Bachelor degree in information technology.</li><li>Fresh Graduates are welcome to apply, or 1-5+ years experience.</li><li>Deep understanding of back-end technologies such as Node.js and popular frameworks like NestJS.</li><li>Deep understanding of front-end technologies such as Tailwind, Javascript, Typescript, and popular frameworks like React.</li><li>Extensive experience with database systems such as MySQL, Redis, MongoDB, or PostgreSQL.</li><li>Strong leadership and mentoring skills, with the ability to inspire and guide a development team.</li><li>Knowledge of ERP systems such as Manufacturing, Supply Chain Management or Product Lifecycle Management is a plus.</li><li>Willing to work on-site and full-time in Bintaro, South Tangerang</li></ul><p><br></p>",
